WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.824
PostgreSQL 18 da COPY va CSV fayl tuzilishi

00:12.824 --> 00:23.855
Sukut bo‘yicha xato va tranzaksiyaning bekor bo‘lishi

00:23.855 --> 00:36.649
ON_ERROR ignore va LOG_VERBOSITY verbose

00:36.649 --> 00:47.716
REJECT_LIMIT bilan xatolar sonini chegaralash

00:47.716 --> 01:00.828
Server ruxsati xatosi va psql dagi \copy yechimi

01:00.828 --> 01:13.780
So‘rov natijasini CSV ga chiqarish va xulosa
